{"id":"desyat_","lemma":"десять","pos":"num","rank":468,"glosses":["ten (10)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/29/Ru-%D0%B4%D0%B5%D1%81%D1%8F%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg/Ru-%D0%B4%D0%B5%D1%81%D1%8F%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Дайте мне десять минут.","en":"Give me ten minutes.","words":[{"g":"to give","l":"дать"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},null,null]},{"text":"Вы были дома в десять?","en":"Were you home at ten?","words":[{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},{"g":"were","l":"быть"},{"g":"at home"},{"g":"in"},null]},{"text":"Можешь подождать десять минут?","en":"Can you wait ten minutes?","words":[{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"to wait"},null,null]},{"text":"Я десять лет его знаю.","en":"I've known him for ten years.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"year","l":"год"},{"g":"him / his"},{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"}]},{"text":"Я пойду домой в десять.","en":"I'll go home at ten.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to go","l":"пойти"},{"g":"home"},{"g":"in"},null]}]}